     9	---
    10	
    11	Recording a clean check as durable audit evidence, and detecting drift. Part of the [`openclaw policy`](/cli/policy) reference.
    12	
    13	## Accept policy state
    14	
    15	Example JSON output:
    16	
    17	```json
