   596	per reader job. Open the page that matches your task.
   597	
   598	Full Release Validation retains all six Docker seed lanes, QA Smoke,
   599	and Control UI performance through its normal CI child. Every admitted canonical
   600	main run keeps the published-upgrade survivor; the other five Docker seed lanes
   601	run in ordinary manual/release validation, including npm qualification scopes.
   602	Pull requests and exact-head PR fallbacks omit Docker seed and QA Smoke.
   603	See [full release coverage](/ci/release-validation/full-release-validation)
   604	for the exact survivor contract and target compatibility limits.
