   537	
   538	## Downgrade recovery
   539	
   540	Do not reverse migrations with SQL or lower `PRAGMA user_version`,
   541	`schema_meta.schema_version`, or the config writer stamp. Those markers describe
   542	persistent formats; editing them does not restore the older data contract.
   543	
   544	Follow [Downgrade](/install/updating#downgrade) for the managed rollback path,
   545	retained-originals limits, and restoring a verified pre-update backup. A complete
   546	recovery point includes the matching package, config, shared state, and every
   547	agent database. Keep writers stopped while activating restored state.
