   284	| `writeSkill`                                                              | Write skill fixtures. Import from `plugin-sdk/test-fixtures`                                                                                |
   285	| `makeAgentAssistantMessage`                                               | Build agent transcript message fixtures. Import from `plugin-sdk/test-fixtures`                                                             |
