   568	  - You are running Docker test lanes
   569	  - You need the Docker scheduler environment variables
   570	---
   571	
   572	## Full Docker suite (`pnpm test:docker:all`)
   573	
   574	Builds the shared live-test image, packs OpenClaw once as an npm tarball, builds/reuses a bare Node/Git runner image plus a functional image that installs that tarball into `/app`, then runs Docker smoke lanes through a weighted scheduler. `scripts/package-openclaw-for-docker.mjs` is the stable local/CI package packer entrypoint and validates the tarball plus `dist/postinstall-inventory.json` before Docker consumes it.
   575	
   576	- Bare image (`OPENCLAW_DOCKER_E2E_BARE_IMAGE`): installer/update/plugin-dependency lanes; mounts the prebuilt tarball instead of copied repo sources.
   577	- Functional image (`OPENCLAW_DOCKER_E2E_FUNCTIONAL_IMAGE`): normal built-app functionality lanes.
   578	- Lane definitions: `scripts/lib/docker-e2e-scenarios.mts`. Planner: `scripts/lib/docker-e2e-plan.mts`. Executor: `scripts/test-docker-all.mjs`.
   579	- `node scripts/test-docker-all.mjs --plan-json` emits the scheduler-owned CI plan (lanes, image kinds, package/live-image needs, state scenarios, credential checks) without building or running Docker.
   580	
   581	Scheduling knobs (env vars, defaults in parentheses):
   582	
   583	| Env var                                                                                                         | Default             | Purpose                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
   584	| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
   585	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_PARALLELISM`                                                                               | 10                  | Process slots.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
   586	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_TAIL_PARALLELISM`                                                                          | 10                  | Provider-sensitive tail pool.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
   587	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_LIVE_LIMIT`                                                                                | 9                   | Heavy live-provider lane cap.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
   588	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_NPM_LIMIT`                                                                                 | 5                   | npm-resource lane cap.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
   589	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_SERVICE_LIMIT`                                                                             | 7                   | Service-resource lane cap.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
   590	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_LIVE_CLAUDE_LIMIT` / `_CODEX_LIMIT` / `_GEMINI_LIMIT` / `_DROID_LIMIT` / `_OPENCODE_LIMIT` | 4                   | Per-provider heavy-lane caps.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
   591	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_LIVE_OPENAI_LIMIT` / `_TELEGRAM_LIMIT`                                                     | 1                   | Narrower per-provider caps.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
   592	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_WEIGHT_LIMIT` / `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_DOCKER_LIMIT`                                         | -                   | Override for larger hosts.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
   593	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_START_STAGGER_MS`                                                                          | 2000                | Delay between lane starts, avoids local Docker daemon create storms.                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
   594	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_LANE_TIMEOUT_MS`                                                                           | 7,200,000 (120 min) | Per-lane fallback timeout; selected live/tail lanes use tighter caps.                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
   595	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_DRY_RUN`                                                                                   | off                 | Print the lane manifest without running Docker.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
   596	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_STATUS_INTERVAL_MS`                                                                        | 30000               | Active-lane status print interval.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
   597	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_TIMINGS`                                                                                   | on                  | Reuse `.artifacts/docker-tests/lane-timings.json` for longest-first ordering; set to `0` to disable.                                                                                                                                                                                       |
   598	| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_LIVE_MODE`                                                                                 | -                   | `skip` for deterministic/local lanes only, `only` for live-provider lanes only. Aliases: `pnpm test:docker:local:all`, `pnpm test:docker:live:all`. Live-only mode merges main and tail live lanes into one longest-first pool so provider buckets pack Claude/Codex/Gemini work together. |
   599	| `OPENCLAW_LIVE_CLI_BACKEND_SETUP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`                                                               | 180                 | CLI backend Docker setup timeout.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
   600	
   601	Env var pattern for resource caps is `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_<RESOURCE>_LIMIT` (resource name uppercased, non-alphanumerics collapsed to `_`).
   602	
   603	Each lane executes once; test, provider, and timeout failures remain failed in the run summary.
   604	
   605	Other behavior: the runner preflights Docker by default, cleans stale OpenClaw E2E containers, shares provider CLI tool caches between compatible lanes, and stops scheduling new pooled lanes after the first failure unless `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_ALL_FAIL_FAST=0` is set. If one lane exceeds the effective weight/resource cap on a low-parallelism host, it can still start from an empty pool and run alone until it releases capacity. Per-lane logs, `summary.json`, `failures.json`, and phase timings write under `.artifacts/docker-tests/<run-id>/`; use `pnpm test:docker:timings <summary.json>` to inspect slow lanes and `pnpm test:docker:rerun <run-id|summary.json|failures.json>` to print cheap targeted rerun commands.
   606	
