   611	| `pnpm test:docker:browser-cdp-snapshot`                                                      | Chromium-backed source E2E container with raw CDP + isolated Gateway; `browser doctor --deep` CDP role snapshots include link URLs, cursor-promoted clickables, iframe refs, and frame metadata.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
