   613	| `pnpm test:docker:live-cli-backend:claude`, `:claude:resume`, `:claude:cache`, `:claude:mcp` | Focused CLI backend live probes; `:claude:cache` settles the no-tool prompt shape, then requires at least 90% prompt-cache reuse on the following dirty-workspace resume and on the steady resume after a thinking-level change. Gemini has matching `:resume` and `:mcp` aliases.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
