   770	The chat-loading performance real-Gateway suite records browser timestamps in
   771	`loading-evidence.json` for the history request, data publication, committed row
   772	model, and visual quiescence. A pane update can still display the old row model
   773	while scrolling, so the probe verifies that a retained row's index advances
   774	before checking for 50 ms without transcript mutations, resizing, or scrolling.
   775	It records the start and confirmation of that quiet interval separately; the
   776	confirmation delay is not application latency. A nonzero `lateChanges` count
   777	invalidates that quiescence sample.
